ASSISTANT The flow would be:
ASSISTANT 1. Generate a random salt (8 bytes) as before
ASSISTANT 2. Spawn `openssl enc -e -aes-128-cbc -pbkdf2 -iter <n> -pass stdin -S <hex-salt>`, piping the passphrase to stdin and the plaintext as input
ASSISTANT 3. Capture the PEM output and return it as the string
