ASSISTANT - `derive_aes_key` and the manual `encrypt_to_pem` function can be removed entirely
ASSISTANT - `SymmetricKeyValue` no longer needs to derive an AES key — it just provides the passphrase
ASSISTANT - `EncryptionParams` only needs to store the salt (the IV is derived by OpenSSL internally)
