USER ASSISTANT 
USER ASSISTANT - The cipher is **AES-128-CBC**
USER ASSISTANT - The encrypted PEM uses the **OpenSSL `enc` format**: `"Salted__" | salt (8 bytes) | ciphertext`
USER ASSISTANT - The PEM envelope headers are `-----BEGIN ENCRYPTED DATA-----` / `-----END ENCRYPTED DATA-----`
